      "final_message": "The key is `AUD-ORDER-7781`. I also ran `audit.write_audit(\"order\", \"7781\")` directly, and it returned exactly that key.\n\nHow the key is built:\n1. `service.checkout(\"7781\")` calls `write_audit(\"order\", \"7781\")` in `audit.py`.\n2. `write_audit` builds the key with `_format_key(kind, ident)`, which returns `f\"{AUDIT_PREFIX}-{kind.upper()}-{ident}\"`.\n3. `AUDIT_PREFIX` is `\"AUD\"` in `config.py`, so the result is `AUD-ORDER-7781`.\n\n`decoy_metrics.py` uses the `MET` prefix but writes to a separate metrics dict, not the audit log.\n\nANSWER: AUD-ORDER-7781",
